+## Billing
+
+Hosted plans use Stripe Checkout and the Stripe customer portal. Configure
+`STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`, `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, and the Stripe monthly price IDs
+before enabling checkout. The app accepts direct plan price IDs through
+`STRIPE_PRICE_UNLIMITED` and `STRIPE_PRICE_UNLIMITED_PLUS`. It also supports the
+existing monthly base/add-on setup: `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID` is the $20
